          "label": "Off: untouched decode. Fast (default): the native Rust-side shadow + chroma-wavelet denoise on linear RAW data, before any tone curve — a few seconds, applies automatically. High: additionally runs a neural (RawNIND UtNet2) denoiser, 25–90s at 24MP — never automatic; press &quot;Denoise now&quot; below, or it runs once at export if selected. Requires reopening this photo (or Denoise now) to take effect. Desktop/RAW only.",
