          ],
          "label": "Real-photo review (5 ISO 12800 shots vs DxO PureRAW) found full strength can soften fine hair/fur strands more than DxO does, even though flat-area noise removal is comparable or better — lower this if High is smoothing detail you want to keep. Changing it re-arms Denoise now / re-applies at next export.",
          "dynamic": false,
          "familyMembership": [
            "button",
            "info-button",
            "slider"
          ]
        },
        {
